Java: `resetTime > currentTime` ⇔ `resetMs*1000 > now.ms` ⇔ `delay > 0`. ✅ Same condition. No jitter (Java returns waitMs without addJitter). ✅ Matches — good parity detail, the Dart `jittered: false` captures Java's behavior correctly.

